@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed exception handling preserves actual effect knowledge
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Resolve actual operation/attempt and current authority;
if (Input / authority / version refusal?) then (yes)
 :Return safe invalid / denied / conflict result;\nno fabricated mutation or private existence disclosure;
else (no)
 if (Failure before any possible external effect?) then (yes)
  :Resolve local transaction/command outcome;\nrepeat only if bounded contract permits;
 else (possible effect)
  :Retain confirmed / partial / unknown observation;\nreconcile same attempt before consequential repeat;
 endif
endif
:Create restricted bounded diagnostic record;\nexclude credentials and private payload dumps;
:Project truthful user/consumer result with permitted operation reference;
stop
legend bottom
 A caught exception or HTTP timeout cannot prove remote rollback.
 Generic exception middleware must not convert unknown sends/deployments into safe retry buttons.
endlegend
@enduml
